WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.474
A guard walked through Metro City Prison.

2
00:00:04.475 --> 00:00:12.147
"Lights out," she called. "It's bedtime!"

3
00:00:12.148 --> 00:00:16.984
In his cell Mr. Presto grumbled and climbed into bed.

4
00:00:16.985 --> 00:00:22.264
Mrs. Wiggles and Dr. Odd were in nearby cells.

5
00:00:22.265 --> 00:00:26.196
"I hate bedtime!" Mrs. Wiggles said.

6
00:00:26.197 --> 00:00:29.402
The guard ignored the villain.

7
00:00:29.403 --> 00:00:32.748
She walked around a corner.

8
00:00:32.749 --> 00:00:34.927
Then she gasped.

9
00:00:34.928 --> 00:00:37.281
There was a huge hole in the wall.

10
00:00:37.282 --> 00:00:45.030
The guard shouted. "A prisoner escaped!"

11
00:00:45.031 --> 00:00:47.875
*** "Where's Terrell?" Jack

12
00:00:47.876 --> 00:00:50.921
asked. Roxy and Mara were waiting outside Jack's

13
00:00:50.922 --> 00:00:53.932
house. "He's going to be a little late today," Roxy

14
00:00:53.933 --> 00:00:59.406
said. "We can walk to school without

15
00:00:59.407 --> 00:01:02.561
him." The three friends walked along the sidewalk.

16
00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:05.661
"Why is Terrell going to be late?" Jack asked.

17
00:01:05.662 --> 00:01:12.304
Mara chuckled. "He's probably at home, trying to figure out who Rocket Girl really is!"

18
00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:15.011
Jack laughed.

19
00:01:15.012 --> 00:01:20.012
Roxy grinned. "No, he's at a dentist appointment."

20
00:01:20.013 --> 00:01:22.623
Soon they arrived at school.

21
00:01:22.624 --> 00:01:26.433
As they reached their classroom, Roxy heard her watch beep.

22
00:01:26.434 --> 00:01:28.578
"I'll be right in," Roxy said.

23
00:01:28.579 --> 00:01:33.938
"I have to, um, use the restroom."

24
00:01:33.939 --> 00:01:36.503
Roxy ducked around a corner.

25
00:01:36.504 --> 00:01:38.724
"Mayor Bloom," she whispered.

26
00:01:38.725 --> 00:01:40.741
"Is everything okay?"

27
00:01:40.742 --> 00:01:42.893
The mayor looked confused.

28
00:01:42.894 --> 00:01:45.008
"I'm not sure, Rocket Girl.

29
00:01:45.009 --> 00:01:48.467
I think someone escaped from Metro City Prison."

30
00:01:48.468 --> 00:01:50.932
"Who?" Roxy asked.

31
00:01:50.933 --> 00:01:53.431
"I don't know," Mayor Bloom said.

32
00:01:53.432 --> 00:01:56.268
"The guards spent the night checking cells.

33
00:01:56.269 --> 00:01:59.045
All the prisoners are still there."

34
00:01:59.046 --> 00:02:01.074
Roxy scratched her head.

35
00:02:01.075 --> 00:02:02.885
"I don't understand, Mayor.

36
00:02:02.886 --> 00:02:05.336
Why do you think someone escaped?"

37
00:02:05.337 --> 00:02:08.832
"There's a big hole in the prison wall," Mayor Bloom said.

38
00:02:08.833 --> 00:02:11.100
"It's very suspicious."

39
00:02:11.101 --> 00:02:13.449
"Okay, Mayor," Roxy said.

40
00:02:13.450 --> 00:02:15.499
"I’m on my way."

41
00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:20.203
Suddenly the school doors flew open.

42
00:02:20.204 --> 00:02:24.481
Shwoom! A loud humming sound filled the air.

43
00:02:24.482 --> 00:02:26.621
Roxy closed her watch.

44
00:02:26.622 --> 00:02:29.591
She felt an invisible force pulling on her.

45
00:02:29.592 --> 00:02:34.596
Teachers and students flew by, as if a vacuum was pulling them.

46
00:02:34.597 --> 00:02:38.851
Using her super strength, Roxy kept her feet planted on the floor. Mara

47
00:02:38.852 --> 00:02:40.948
and Jack flew by. "Ahh!"

48
00:02:40.949 --> 00:02:44.418
Mara screamed. "Help!"

49
00:02:44.419 --> 00:02:46.662
Jack shouted. Books,

50
00:02:46.663 --> 00:02:50.337
pencils, and papers dropped from backpacks. The

51
00:02:50.338 --> 00:02:52.457
hallway was a mess. A

52
00:02:52.458 --> 00:02:56.998
moment later everyone was gone. "Yikes!"

53
00:02:56.999 --> 00:03:01.291
Roxy thought. "What's going on?" ***

54
00:03:01.292 --> 00:03:04.884
"Huh?" Terrell said. "What happened?"

55
00:03:04.885 --> 00:03:07.947
He was standing in front of Metro City Elementary School.

56
00:03:07.948 --> 00:03:10.061
Papers and books lay on the blacktop.

57
00:03:10.062 --> 00:03:12.508
The doors were wide open.

58
00:03:12.509 --> 00:03:15.900
Terrell ran inside.

59
00:03:15.901 --> 00:03:20.212
At the far end of the hallway, he saw Roxy dart into a restroom.

60
00:03:20.213 --> 00:03:22.289
Terrell hurried down the hallway.

61
00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:33.278
A second later the restroom door banged open, and Rocket Girl burst out!

